WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:05.110
I got a call from a brand new dad this morning.

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:10.530
Take a listen to this voicemail left to me
at two one nine two.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.530
David P..

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:16.020
Hey, David long-Time, listener, First-Time
Caller here from Seattle.

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:17.020
Yes.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.660
Well, listen in on my daughter.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.939
My first daughter was born in.

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:26.119
About 20 minutes ago, one of my first stops
is Wow.

00:00:26.119 --> 00:00:27.119
Oh, my gosh.

00:00:27.119 --> 00:00:32.119
I just brought a child into this world during
this election and during everything that's

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:33.119
going on.

00:00:33.119 --> 00:00:37.399
I just love for you to give a shout out on
your show to my daughter, Nicoya, just reassuring

00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:40.960
you that I'm going to be able to raise my
daughter as well.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:41.960
All right.

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:42.960
Thank you.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.020
You do a great job, and I really appreciate
your work.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:46.519
Well, listen, congratulations.

00:00:46.519 --> 00:00:49.660
Welcome to the world, to Nicoya.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:52.000
I think we have to be realistic here.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.000
You're weak.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.000
We don't have control.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.440
Much like I said to the caller yesterday.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:58.660
The philosophy of stoicism comes to mind.

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:08.010
Clearly, what matters is whether this new
dad does everything he can to improve the

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:10.050
world for his daughter.

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:12.800
Ultimately, it is not up to him.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:19.630
A planet of seven eight billion people is
not one that can be controlled by just one

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:20.630
person.

00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:25.150
But the fact that you're thinking in these
terms tells me that you're going to do a great

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:31.910
job and we all have to work together in order
to create the best possible situation, not

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:35.550
just for our kids, but their kids and their
kids and their kids.

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:40.810
And we do have a monumental event that could
alter the course of history.

